          "kind": "MCQ",
          "points": 0.2,
          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Select the statement that is most correct.<br/>Suppose we are considering a singly linked list which has at least 2 nodes. What does the java code snippet below do?</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">f</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> head;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span>(f.next != tail) f = f.next;\nf.next = <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>;\ntail = f;</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Chọn phát biểu đúng nhất.<br/>Giả sử ta đang xét một danh sách liên kết đơn có ít nhất 2 nút. Đoạn mã java dưới đây làm gì?</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">f</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> head;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span>(f.next != tail) f = f.next;\nf.next = <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>;\ntail = f;</code></pre></div>",
